In infra/modules/container_apps/main.tf, at line 270, the frontend container app has 
an env block:

  BACKEND_BASE_URL = var.backend_base_url

Replace this with a self-reference to the backend container app created in this same 
module, so it no longer depends on an external variable:

  BACKEND_BASE_URL = "https://${azurerm_container_app.backend.ingress[0].fqdn}"

Then, in variables.tf, remove the "backend_base_url" variable declaration entirely, 
since it is no longer used anywhere.

After making this change, confirm no other references to var.backend_base_url remain 
anywhere in the module.




grep -n "backend_base_url" infra/modules/container_apps/*.tf

grep -n "ingress\[0\].fqdn" infra/modules/container_apps/main.tf
